{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於籃球、排球及田徑運動員而言，精準掌握彈跳數據是提升表現的關鍵。JumpBoost 是一款利用人工智能技術，僅需一部智能手機即可在數秒內完成垂直彈跳測量的應用程序。該 App 無需任何額外裝備或複雜設置，現正提供限時免費下載機會。</p>\n\n<h2>AI 自動分析彈跳數據</h2>\n<p>用戶只需透過單一影片拍攝，App 便能即時分析並提供關鍵指標，包括彈跳高度、滯空時間、速度以及膝蓋與髖部角度。此外，它支援運動員管理功能，可追蹤整支隊伍的數據，並提供 CSV 格式匯出以進行深度分析。全程離線運作且注重私隱，不儲存原始影片，讓運動訓練更科學高效。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-37-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：JumpBoost</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T12:20:03.503616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}